<section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>About Mediscan AI</h1>
        <p>
            We are building intelligent, responsible AI solutions that make
            healthcare information clearer, safer, and more accessible for everyone.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="about-content">
    <div class="container">

        <div class="about-split-container">
            <div class="about-split-row">
                <div class="about-text-content">
                    <span class="section-tag">Our Identity</span>
                    <h2>Who We Are</h2>
                    <p>Mediscan AI is a health-focused AI platform created to transform complex medical reports into structured, meaningful insights. We operate at the intersection of artificial intelligence, healthcare responsibility, and user-centered design.</p>
                    <p>Our approach combines technological precision with ethical awareness — ensuring that clarity never comes at the cost of safety.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="about-visual-box">
                    <div class="abstract-shape shape-1"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="about-split-row reverse">
                <div class="about-text-content">
                    <span class="section-tag">The Problem</span>
                    <h2>Why We Built This</h2>
                    <p>Millions of patients receive diagnostic reports filled with technical terminology, unfamiliar abbreviations, and unclear risk indicators. This often leads to confusion, anxiety, or unnecessary online searches.</p>
                    <p>We built Mediscan AI to bridge this gap — helping individuals better understand their health information while encouraging informed discussions with healthcare professionals.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="about-visual-box">
                    <div class="abstract-shape shape-2"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vision-banner">
            <h2>Our Vision</h2>
            <p>To create a future where understanding your medical information is effortless — regardless of language, background, or medical knowledge.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="values-section">
            <h2 class="center-title">Our Core Values</h2>
            <div class="values-grid">
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon">🔒</div>
                    <h3>Privacy & Security</h3>
                    <p>Your medical data is handled with strict confidentiality, secure processing, and responsible AI practices.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon">🎯</div>
                    <h3>Clarity First</h3>
                    <p>We prioritize explanations that are understandable, structured, and free from unnecessary complexity.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon">🤝</div>
                    <h3>Human-Centered AI</h3>
                    <p>Our technology is designed to assist and empower — never to replace professional medical advice.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon">🌍</div>
                    <h3>Accessibility for All</h3>
                    <p>Healthcare understanding should not depend on language, education level, or technical background.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

